+// equin: whether kqueue's vnode filter can watch what `path` is, decided by
+// its kind before any open(2). Only a regular file or a folder (a symlink
+// followed to one) is opened. A socket refuses the open (EOPNOTSUPP: "error
+// watching ~/.equin/sockets: Operation not supported on socket", which failed
